        <h2 class="subtitle" data-en="The Multi-Level Threat" data-es="La Amenaza Multi-Nivel">The Multi-Level Threat</h2>
        <p class="info" data-en="Deepfakes are not just a simple deception; they are a disinformation weapon with tangible consequences that affect social stability, the economy, and private life." data-es="El Deepfake no es un simple engaño; es un arma de desinformación con consecuencias tangibles que afectan la estabilidad social, la economía y la vida privada."><span style="padding-left: 30px;"></span>Deepfakes are not just a simple deception; they are a disinformation weapon with tangible consequences that affect social stability, the economy, and private life.</p>
      </div>
