          <li>
            <strong class="info" data-en="Electoral Manipulation:" data-es="Manipulación Electoral:">Electoral Manipulation:</strong>
            <p class="info" data-en="Creation of fake videos of politicians making inflammatory statements. The content is released during the ''October Surprise Factor'' (just before elections), making timely verification impossible." data-es="Creación de videos falsos de políticos haciendo declaraciones incendiarias. El contenido se lanza en el ''Factor Octubre Sorpresa'' (justo antes de elecciones), haciendo imposible la verificación oportuna.">Creation of fake videos of politicians making inflammatory statements. The content is released during the "October Surprise Factor" (just before elections), making timely verification impossible.</p>
          </li>          
          <li>
            <strong class="info" data-en="Erosion of Trust:" data-es="Erosión de la Confianza:">Erosion of Trust:</strong>
            <p class="info" data-en="The public doubts all official audiovisual communications (whether real or fake), weakening institutional authority and faith in objective truth." data-es="El público duda de todos los comunicados audiovisuales oficiales (sean reales o falsos), debilitando la autoridad institucional y la fe en la verdad objetiva.">The public doubts all official audiovisual communications (whether real or fake), weakening institutional authority and faith in objective truth.</p>
          </li>
